# Architecture documentation

Read `docs/architecture.md` before changing component boundaries, then the relevant linked page.
Update the affected docs when agent/context/tool/execution/debug behavior changes.
Describe current behavior, guarantees and limits; do not retain obsolete designs as current documentation.
Example: adding a query requires its schema/registry, regression tests and updated tool/context docs.
Keep test prompts under `tests/fixtures/prompts/` and production prompts under `prompts/`.
Preserve unfinished agent prompts unless the user requests their modification.
